      "content": "wait, why did you rank alexander so low for leadership? he was literally a debate captain and went to yale, shouldn't that be a huge plus for a management role? and what do u mean by jamal being \"too out there\"? i thought the role required someone who could connect with people. can u explain why you think the others have better \"culture fit\" than him?",
